---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = 'March 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of Use for the Filthy Rich Soil Co. website — conditions for using our site and services."
>

<style is:global>
  .terms-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: #013220;
    padding: 160px 5% 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .terms-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #FAF7F0;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .terms-hero p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .terms-body {
    background: #FAF7F0;
    padding: 72px 5% 100px;
  }
  .terms-inner {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .terms-inner h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #013220;
    margin: 44px 0 12px;
  }
  .terms-inner h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .terms-inner p {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    color: #3a3a3a;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .terms-inner ul {
    margin: 0 0 14px 20px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .terms-inner ul li {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    color: #3a3a3a;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .terms-inner a {
    color: #013220;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .terms-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(1,50,32,0.15);
    margin: 40px 0;
  }
  .terms-updated {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: rgba(1,50,32,0.45);
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(1,50,32,0.12);
  }
</style>

<section class="terms-hero">
  <span class="hero-eyebrow">Legal</span>
  <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
  <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>
</section>

<div class="terms-body">
  <div class="terms-inner">

    <h2>Agreement to Terms</h2>
    <p>By accessing or using the Filthy Rich Soil Co. website at filthyrichsoilco.com ("the Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use the Site. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time, and your continued use of the Site following any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Description of Services</h2>
    <p>Filthy Rich Soil Co. provides ecological land stewardship services in Chester County, Pennsylvania. The Site serves as an informational resource about our services and provides tools for prospective clients and applicants to contact us, including a consultation request form and a career application form.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Consultation Estimates and Proposals</h2>
    <p>The free site walkthrough offered through this Site is a complimentary visit and does not include a written report, estimate, or pricing of any kind.</p>
    <p>The Soil & Site Assessment is a separate, paid deliverable — a written report based on on-site testing and inspection. Its fee is credited toward a signed one-year stewardship agreement should you choose to move forward. Program scope and pricing are determined only within a signed stewardship agreement between you and Filthy Rich Soil Co.; nothing on this Site constitutes a binding offer, estimate, or guarantee of pricing.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>All content on this Site — including text, photography, graphics, logos, page layouts, and design elements — is the property of Filthy Rich Soil Co. or its content suppliers and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from any content on this Site without our prior written consent.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>User Conduct</h2>
    <p>When using the Site, you agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Submit false, misleading, or fraudulent information through any form on the Site</li>
      <li>Attempt to interfere with the proper functioning of the Site</li>
      <li>Use any automated system (including bots, scrapers, or spiders) to access the Site in a manner that sends more requests than a human could reasonably produce</li>
      <li>Use the Site for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable laws or regulations</li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>The Site may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or controlled by Filthy Rich Soil Co. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for, the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services. We encourage you to review the terms and privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
    <p>The Site and its content are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. Filthy Rich Soil Co. does not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.</p>
    <p>While we strive to provide accurate and current information about our services, we make no guarantees regarding the completeness, accuracy, or reliability of any content on the Site. Information about ecological practices, soil health, and land stewardship is provided for general educational purposes and should not be taken as professional scientific advice for your specific property without a formal on-site assessment.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Filthy Rich Soil Co., its owner, employees, and affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of the Site. This includes, but is not limited to, damages for loss of profits, data, or other intangible losses, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>
    <p>Our total liability for any claim arising from your use of the Site shall not exceed the amount you have paid to Filthy Rich Soil Co. in the 12 months preceding the claim, or $100, whichever is greater.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Indemnification</h2>
    <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Filthy Rich Soil Co. and its owner, employees, and affiliates from any claims, damages, losses, liabilities, or expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from your use of the Site, your violation of these Terms, or your violation of any rights of a third party.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Governing Law</h2>
    <p>These Terms of Use are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising under these terms shall be resolved in the courts of Chester County, Pennsylvania.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Severability</h2>
    <p>If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable or invalid, that provision shall be limited or eliminated to the minimum extent necessary so that the remaining provisions continue in full force and effect.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>Your use of the Site is also governed by our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, which describes how we collect, use, and protect your personal information. By using the Site, you consent to the practices described in that policy.</p>

    <hr class="terms-divider" />

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us at:</p>
    <p>
      <strong>Filthy Rich Soil Co.</strong><br>
      Chester County, PA<br>
      <a href="mailto:dan@filthyrichsoilco.com">dan@filthyrichsoilco.com</a>
    </p>

    <p class="terms-updated">These terms were last updated in {updated}.</p>

  </div>
</div>

</Base>
